00:54:33.663 --> 00:54:36.633
and I'll show you the
woman he's hidin' from.


00:54:43.907 --> 00:54:46.511
This is the single biggest
case this division's ever seen.


00:54:46.578 --> 00:54:48.013
Listen to me, I
spoke to the bureau.


00:54:48.078 --> 00:54:49.511
I think they're willing
to go as high as 30 grand.


00:54:49.513 --> 00:54:50.982
All right.


00:54:51.014 --> 00:54:55.485
Do you think you can
stay in there a little longer?


00:55:02.592 --> 00:55:05.663
The husband works in
an abandoned coal mine.


00:55:05.697 --> 00:55:07.029
This is his headquarters.


00:55:07.031 --> 00:55:08.697
This is an overview of
the entire compound.


00:55:08.699 --> 00:55:10.001
It's filled with many warehouses


00:55:10.034 --> 00:55:12.701
we believe can hold up to
5,000 pounds of marijuana.


00:55:14.871 --> 00:55:17.375
I will
faithfully execute the office


00:55:17.440 --> 00:55:19.543
of President of
the United States.


00:55:19.610 --> 00:55:21.779
And will,
to the best of my abilities.


00:55:21.811 --> 00:55:23.980
And will,
to the best of my abilities.


00:55:24.014 --> 00:55:25.216
Preserve, protect,


00:55:25.281 --> 00:55:26.817
and defend the Constitution.


00:56:01.085 --> 00:56:04.089
I told you you
can't come here.


00:56:05.755 --> 00:56:07.088
Where were you?


00:56:08.926 --> 00:56:11.763
I waited at the
motel for an hour.


00:56:13.197 --> 00:56:14.766
I told you sometimes
things would come up


00:56:14.833 --> 00:56:16.601
and I wouldn't be
able to see you.


00:56:16.668 --> 00:56:18.266
Okay?
I told you that.


00:56:18.268 --> 00:56:20.270
Why didn't you call?


00:56:20.337 --> 00:56:22.706
'Cause something came up.


00:56:23.373 --> 00:56:24.875
Why didn't you answer...


00:56:24.909 --> 00:56:27.712
'Cause something
came up, Susan.


00:56:28.846 --> 00:56:32.614
Susan, I can't always drop
everything for you, okay?


00:56:32.616 --> 00:56:33.750
I have a job.


00:56:35.520 --> 00:56:36.721
Have a family.


00:56:36.753 --> 00:56:38.623
But I need you, too.


00:56:44.094 --> 00:56:45.797
When me and Cash...


00:56:47.096 --> 00:56:50.967
were in Pittsburgh,
we knew a drug dealer


00:56:51.034 --> 00:56:54.438
who had a cop in his
pocket, a captain.


00:57:03.112 --> 00:57:05.382
Now, you gotta look
into that, don't you?


00:57:06.583 --> 00:57:09.487
It'd be a feather in
your cap, wouldn't it?


00:57:09.554 --> 00:57:13.657
To bust a crooked captain
on the Pittsburgh PD.


00:57:16.094 --> 00:57:17.395
When was this?


00:57:17.427 --> 00:57:21.331
Before I got pregnant
by Cash like a fool.


00:57:24.168 --> 00:57:26.003
All right, listen.


00:57:26.069 --> 00:57:28.071
We'll talk about
it sometime, okay?


00:57:28.105 --> 00:57:29.307
When?


00:57:29.907 --> 00:57:31.342
I'll call you.


00:57:32.810 --> 00:57:33.811
When?


00:57:34.612 --> 00:57:35.679
Tomorrow.


00:57:35.746 --> 00:57:36.748
I promise.


00:57:59.536 --> 00:58:00.538
What?


00:58:02.105 --> 00:58:04.308
Did you have fun at
the Red Clay Motel?


00:58:04.342 --> 00:58:05.676
No.


00:58:05.710 --> 00:58:06.476
Bullshit.


00:58:07.478 --> 00:58:09.980
Bumpy said he saw you
comin' outta there.


00:58:10.014 --> 00:58:11.315
I didn't say I wasn't there.


00:58:11.348 --> 00:58:14.217
I said I didn't have no fun.


00:58:14.284 --> 00:58:15.786
What did Bumpy do,
anyway, run up here


00:58:15.819 --> 00:58:18.355
and squeal so you could
get him high, right?


00:58:18.389 --> 00:58:19.887
What are you...


00:58:19.889 --> 00:58:21.658
Why don't you go stay
at your boyfriend's house,


00:58:21.692 --> 00:58:22.793
whoever he is?


00:58:23.728 --> 00:58:24.662
You c...


00:58:25.194 --> 00:58:26.463
You can't do this.


00:58:26.496 --> 00:58:29.866
If you come in here, I'll
break your fuckin' neck.


00:58:29.900 --> 00:58:30.701
No.


00:58:30.735 --> 00:58:31.970
No, Cash.


00:58:32.002 --> 00:58:33.237
Cash, you can't!


00:58:34.071 --> 00:58:37.375
You get
the hell outta here!


00:58:48.418 --> 00:58:50.755
We have to let her stay, Mark.


00:58:50.821 --> 00:58:52.556
At least for tonight.


00:58:52.589 --> 00:58:56.360
Tomorrow, she can move
in with her sister.


00:58:58.194 --> 00:58:59.263
We have to.


00:58:59.330 --> 00:59:00.931
She can't go home.


00:59:01.998 --> 00:59:03.600
I don't believe that.


00:59:03.667 --> 00:59:06.069
You think that
she's making it up?


00:59:06.103 --> 00:59:07.871
I wouldn't
put it past her.


00:59:07.904 --> 00:59:10.072
She's not a liar.


00:59:10.107 --> 00:59:11.942
How do you know?


00:59:12.009 --> 00:59:13.877
'Cause I know that you
would never take the word


00:59:13.911 --> 00:59:17.915
of an informant that
you knew to be a liar.


00:59:17.949 --> 00:59:21.116
Long-fought battle
to become a serious artist.


00:59:21.118 --> 00:59:23.020
Then she steeped
into the spotlight,


00:59:23.052 --> 00:59:25.788
and she is quite remarkable.


00:59:25.855 --> 00:59:28.691
Still quick to protect
her private life,


00:59:28.726 --> 00:59:32.196
she's still a genius at
marketing her talent.


01:01:23.406 --> 01:01:26.209
I could
tell he was pullin' away.


01:01:26.243 --> 01:01:29.413
I just figured I could
reel him back in.


01:01:30.413 --> 01:01:33.081
Then I found out what
was really goin' on.


01:01:33.083 --> 01:01:34.851
Can I tell you my news now?


01:01:34.884 --> 01:01:35.852
Sure.


01:01:35.886 --> 01:01:37.487
Sure, what's that?


01:01:39.857 --> 01:01:41.092
I'm pregnant.


01:01:49.933 --> 01:01:50.935
Due in March.


01:01:52.435 --> 01:01:54.171
Which wasn't part
of the plan, but...


01:01:54.904 --> 01:01:56.440
it's great anyway.


01:01:57.440 --> 01:01:58.942
Don't you think?


01:02:02.179 --> 01:02:03.748
It's incredible.


01:02:07.451 --> 01:02:08.452
I'd
been fornicatin'


01:02:08.518 --> 01:02:10.453
like a long-eared rabbit,


01:02:10.520 --> 01:02:12.954
and Kathy gets pregnant?


01:02:12.956 --> 01:02:13.788
Shit.


01:02:56.067 --> 01:02:57.134
Hey, Susie.


01:03:04.007 --> 01:03:06.076
How y'all doin'?


01:03:06.110 --> 01:03:07.111
How's Cash?


01:03:09.846 --> 01:03:13.783
Yeah, everything's
okay, thanks, Rufus.


01:03:13.817 --> 01:03:16.752
Well, I hope
business is good, too.


01:03:16.786 --> 01:03:19.523
It's almost end of the month.


01:03:29.866 --> 01:03:31.435
Now, what's got you so upset


01:03:31.467 --> 01:03:36.040
you had to come all the way
here and tell me about it?


01:03:37.674 --> 01:03:42.045
The FBI is about to bust
your pot smuggling deal.


01:03:47.884 --> 01:03:49.819
And how the fuck
would you know?


01:03:49.853 --> 01:03:52.156
Trust me, Rufus, I know.


01:05:27.616 --> 01:05:28.985
We're up on the hill
watchin' the place,


01:05:29.052 --> 01:05:32.288
and just before dawn two trucks
came down goin' real fast.


01:05:32.322 --> 01:05:35.659
Couldn't get down here
near in time to catch 'em.


01:05:35.726 --> 01:05:37.061
Yeah, I heard.


01:05:37.895 --> 01:05:40.464
We won't all his
connections, but


01:05:40.496 --> 01:05:41.764
there is enough
loose pot around here


01:05:41.799 --> 01:05:43.567
to make an interstate
trafficking case


01:05:43.601 --> 01:05:45.903
against old Rufus Greene.


01:05:50.306 --> 01:05:51.609
Sorry, Mark.


01:05:51.641 --> 01:05:53.977
No, it's not your fault.


01:05:56.679 --> 01:05:58.982
The hell y'all doin' here?


01:05:59.014 --> 01:06:01.752
This is a crime
scene, Mr. Greene.


01:06:01.784 --> 01:06:03.487
This is my property.


01:06:03.520 --> 01:06:04.518
You want to confess to


01:06:04.520 --> 01:06:06.822
interstate trafficking
now, Rufus?


01:06:06.857 --> 01:06:08.993
Or do you want to wait
til you're indicted?


01:06:09.025 --> 01:06:11.161
Now, that'll be the day.


01:06:11.194 --> 01:06:14.531
Now, I ain't been up
this way in years.


01:06:14.598 --> 01:06:16.933
Now, I got plans
for this property,


01:06:16.967 --> 01:06:19.169
but I don't hang around here.


01:06:19.201 --> 01:06:20.936
This is a dump.


01:06:20.971 --> 01:06:23.974
I can back him up
on that, officer.


01:06:24.007 --> 01:06:25.842
I ain't never been up
here before, neither.


01:06:25.875 --> 01:06:27.877
We got photos of
him here, dumb ass.


01:06:27.944 --> 01:06:29.112
Fuck you callin' dumb?


01:06:29.145 --> 01:06:33.049
And it's Special Agent
Putnam to you, boy.


01:06:34.516 --> 01:06:35.652
Well, then you got pictures


01:06:35.685 --> 01:06:39.489
of your little girlfriend
up here too, then.


01:06:39.522 --> 01:06:40.824
That's right.


01:06:43.326 --> 01:06:44.494
What'd you just say?


01:06:44.527 --> 01:06:46.330
You heard me.


01:06:46.362 --> 01:06:48.232
What'd you just say?


01:06:51.467 --> 01:06:53.337
Go on, Rufus.


01:06:53.369 --> 01:06:54.505
He heard me?


01:07:41.384 --> 01:07:42.685
Mommy!


01:07:42.719 --> 01:07:44.284
Mommy!


01:07:46.456 --> 01:07:47.190
Mark!


01:07:47.223 --> 01:07:48.123
- Mommy!
- What?


01:07:48.125 --> 01:07:49.726
Somebody broke the window!


01:07:49.759 --> 01:07:50.895
Inside the house.


01:07:50.927 --> 01:07:52.462
Mommy.


01:07:54.630 --> 01:07:55.799
Mommy.


01:07:55.866 --> 01:08:00.137
Shh, it's
okay, it's okay, sweetie.


01:08:29.632 --> 01:08:30.433
Mommy!


01:08:30.467 --> 01:08:31.468
Mom!


01:08:44.681 --> 01:08:46.116
Hey.


01:08:46.150 --> 01:08:48.451
Who are you expecting
to call, anyway?


01:08:48.485 --> 01:08:49.652
What do you mean?


01:08:49.686 --> 01:08:50.685
I mean you're
guarding the phone


01:08:50.687 --> 01:08:52.623
like you did when you were 13.


01:08:52.655 --> 01:08:54.023
I don't know.


01:08:54.857 --> 01:08:55.525
Nobody.


01:08:56.426 --> 01:08:57.194
Why don't you get outta bed


01:08:57.261 --> 01:08:58.696
and help me with
the groceries, then?


01:09:02.865 --> 01:09:04.968
Sis!
I gotta go.


01:09:06.503 --> 01:09:08.204
Ain't nothin' good
gonna come of that.


01:09:08.271 --> 01:09:09.306
Of what?


01:09:09.338 --> 01:09:10.272
You know what.


01:09:10.307 --> 01:09:12.876
Messin' around with
that goddam federal cop.


01:09:12.942 --> 01:09:15.012
I'm an important informant.


01:09:15.044 --> 01:09:17.114
One day I might disappear
in the witness protection,


01:09:17.146 --> 01:09:20.551
so you better enjoy
me whilst I'm here.


01:09:22.018 --> 01:09:24.487
You're gonna get
yourself killed.


01:09:45.909 --> 01:09:46.908
Rufus Greene sent somebody


01:09:46.910 --> 01:09:49.580
to burn down my
house last night.


01:09:50.547 --> 01:09:52.715
You don't blame me, do you?


01:09:52.749 --> 01:09:54.018
Yeah, I do.


01:09:56.186 --> 01:09:58.422
Well, I did not
tell Rufus Greene


01:09:58.489 --> 01:10:01.525
- about your precious drug bust.
- Of course you did, Susan.


01:10:01.557 --> 01:10:02.558
Bullshit.


01:10:03.426 --> 01:10:05.027
Jesus Christ, stop lying.


01:10:05.062 --> 01:10:06.563
My kid was in that house!


01:10:06.596 --> 01:10:07.929
You put my family in danger!


01:10:07.931 --> 01:10:09.098
I did not.


01:10:11.601 --> 01:10:14.036
I got six grand in
this bag here for you.


01:10:14.070 --> 01:10:18.608
You sign this receipt, I'll
give it to you right now.


01:10:21.277 --> 01:10:24.246
I was gonna hold onto it
til after you testified.


01:10:24.280 --> 01:10:29.119
Then I realised I needed to
get through this encounter.


01:10:30.587 --> 01:10:33.255
This encounter's gonna
be hard for you, huh?


01:10:33.289 --> 01:10:35.292
No, it's gonna
be hard for you.


01:10:35.359 --> 01:10:37.125
I don't want to see you anymore.


01:10:37.127 --> 01:10:38.527
Do you understand?


01:10:38.561 --> 01:10:39.529
Only unless I have to.


01:10:39.562 --> 01:10:42.232
What does that mean,
"only if you have to"?


01:10:42.266 --> 01:10:43.866
If there's blood on
the ground, call me.


01:10:43.900 --> 01:10:45.302
Otherwise, leave me alone.


01:10:45.368 --> 01:10:46.634
Well, it don't
work that way, Mark.


01:10:46.636 --> 01:10:48.304
It do not work that way!


01:10:48.370 --> 01:10:53.042
This ain't a way to treat
your star-fuckin'-witness!


01:11:47.865 --> 01:11:49.166
Hey, Mom,
it's a Mustang!


01:11:49.199 --> 01:11:50.967
How do you
know what a Mustang is?


01:11:51.000 --> 01:11:52.002
Everyone knows.


01:11:52.035 --> 01:11:53.337
Everyone
knows, do they?


01:11:53.370 --> 01:11:55.672
And my girl knows as well.


01:11:55.705 --> 01:11:57.007
And what do you think, mister?


01:11:57.039 --> 01:11:58.006
Where the hell
you steal that at?


01:11:58.040 --> 01:11:59.642
I love it!


01:12:00.544 --> 01:12:01.945
I bought it.


01:12:01.977 --> 01:12:03.879
With what?


01:12:03.946 --> 01:12:06.114
With half the
four grand I got.


01:12:06.148 --> 01:12:07.316
I'm a give you the other half.


01:12:07.350 --> 01:12:09.218
Where the hell
you get four grand?


01:12:09.285 --> 01:12:14.224
I extorted that guy, that
guy from the Red Clay Motel.


01:12:23.534 --> 01:12:24.500
All right.


01:12:24.534 --> 01:12:25.536
Gimme the money.


01:12:25.569 --> 01:12:26.900
Are we even?


01:12:26.902 --> 01:12:28.637
What do you mean?


01:12:28.672 --> 01:12:30.570
You know what I mean.


01:12:30.572 --> 01:12:31.575
Are we even?


01:12:37.847 --> 01:12:39.682
Yeah.
Gimme the money.


01:12:51.261 --> 01:12:52.161
Tell me who
gave you this money!


01:12:52.195 --> 01:12:53.228
I told you!


01:12:53.262 --> 01:12:56.732
He's a rich guy
from Lector County.


01:13:01.670 --> 01:13:02.769
You don't know him!


01:13:02.771 --> 01:13:04.039
And you don't want to!


01:13:08.111 --> 01:13:09.610
Why'd he give you the money?


01:13:09.612 --> 01:13:11.047
Huh?


01:13:11.079 --> 01:13:12.780
Tell me the truth this time.


01:13:12.782 --> 01:13:15.884
'Cause I sucked his
cock, and that's why!


01:13:20.423 --> 01:13:23.193
Watch your side there.


01:13:24.794 --> 01:13:26.263
Lock her down.


01:13:26.295 --> 01:13:27.630
Got it?


01:13:40.810 --> 01:13:41.812
Let's go.


01:13:57.927 --> 01:13:58.929
Don't.


01:13:59.762 --> 01:14:00.729
You have broken ribs.


01:14:00.762 --> 01:14:01.764
Oh.


01:14:02.798 --> 01:14:06.468
I guess there was blood
on the ground, huh?


01:14:06.503 --> 01:14:09.673
I didn't mean for you
to go and spill some.


01:14:09.740 --> 01:14:10.740
I tell you what.


01:14:10.773 --> 01:14:13.142
If I'd known you to come,


01:14:13.176 --> 01:14:16.847
I woulda kicked his
ass a whole lot sooner.


01:14:20.249 --> 01:14:21.450
You hear me?


01:14:26.489 --> 01:14:28.759
It's from Kathy.


01:14:34.164 --> 01:14:35.799
Oh, God, Mark.


01:14:36.465 --> 01:14:37.600
You are the...


01:14:37.633 --> 01:14:41.504
only man I ever knew
who's been good to me.


01:14:42.871 --> 01:14:44.807
Lock the door, will ya?


01:14:46.610 --> 01:14:50.179
I'm trying to stop
betraying my wife.


01:14:50.213 --> 01:14:54.518
And she thinks if I avoid
you, I'm betraying you.


01:14:57.219 --> 01:15:00.656
I feel like I'm
lettin' everybody down.


01:15:03.493 --> 01:15:04.060
Susan?


01:15:04.694 --> 01:15:08.563
Look, you gotta stay away
from Cash until the trial.


01:15:08.830 --> 01:15:09.632
I want you in good shape


01:15:09.665 --> 01:15:10.732
if you're gonna
testify against...


01:15:10.799 --> 01:15:12.502
I need you, Mark.


01:15:20.176 --> 01:15:21.578
More than ever.


01:15:30.719 --> 01:15:33.990
If you go, I don't
know what I'll do.


01:16:07.789 --> 01:16:08.456
Okay?


01:16:09.392 --> 01:16:10.360
Look, you're gonna be fine.


01:16:10.392 --> 01:16:12.127
All you gotta do
is tell the truth.


01:16:12.195 --> 01:16:13.397
All right?


01:16:15.697 --> 01:16:16.700
Okay.


01:16:22.371 --> 01:16:25.807
You ready to
meet your new partner?


01:16:25.874 --> 01:16:27.109
My what?


01:16:27.142 --> 01:16:29.044
Your new partner.


01:16:29.078 --> 01:16:32.281
Bob Singer, this
is Mark Putnam.


01:16:32.315 --> 01:16:34.982
I don't like carrying rookies.


01:16:34.984 --> 01:16:36.218
You shouldn't have to, Bob.


01:16:36.252 --> 01:16:40.423
Obviously you're
carrying enough as it is.


01:16:40.455 --> 01:16:42.924
Bob worked undercover
drugs in Baltimore.


01:16:42.959 --> 01:16:44.324
Tough duty.


01:16:44.326 --> 01:16:45.393
Somebody tried to kill him,


01:16:45.428 --> 01:16:47.496
so the bureau
transferred him here.


01:16:47.562 --> 01:16:49.297
Someone who'd make
your little bank robber


01:16:49.331 --> 01:16:51.468
look like a schoolgirl.


01:16:52.668 --> 01:16:53.969
If somebody tries to kill you,


01:16:54.004 --> 01:16:55.138
the bureau will transfer you?


01:16:55.172 --> 01:16:56.502
Of course.


01:16:56.504 --> 01:16:58.674
Think of the liability.


01:17:33.142 --> 01:17:34.144
Snitch!


01:17:50.392 --> 01:17:52.561
Raise your right hand.


01:17:59.669 --> 01:18:02.038
Do you solemnly swear to tell
the truth, the whole truth,


01:18:02.070 --> 01:18:05.907
and nothin' but the
truth, so help you God?


01:18:05.975 --> 01:18:07.209
Yeah, I do.


01:18:07.243 --> 01:18:08.911
Please be seated.


01:18:10.713 --> 01:18:13.983
How long
have you known Mr. Reevis?


01:18:14.016 --> 01:18:18.087
Since he got outta prison
and come stay with us.


01:18:18.154 --> 01:18:20.924
Last year in the
spring, I guess.


01:18:22.258 --> 01:18:23.925
The fall.


01:18:23.927 --> 01:18:25.328
I'm sorry, I...


01:18:25.361 --> 01:18:26.929
I didn't mean that.
I was confused.


01:18:26.996 --> 01:18:28.597
It's been a while.


01:18:29.766 --> 01:18:31.000
In the fall.


01:18:31.032 --> 01:18:32.334
All right.


01:18:32.369 --> 01:18:34.504
Could you tell us,
in your own words,


01:18:34.536 --> 01:18:36.906
what you found in his room?


01:18:38.607 --> 01:18:39.941
He had a green
duffel bag with two


01:18:40.008 --> 01:18:44.110
sawed off shotguns in it
and two black ski masks.


01:18:44.112 --> 01:18:45.248
- Liar!
- You are a liar!


01:18:46.883 --> 01:18:48.448
Thank
you very much, Miss Smith.


01:18:48.450 --> 01:18:50.587
Thank you for your courage.


01:18:50.620 --> 01:18:53.756
You've begun to make it safe
for a person in Pike County


01:18:53.789 --> 01:18:57.060
to go into the bank and
deposit their paycheck


01:18:57.093 --> 01:18:58.061
without being...


01:18:58.093 --> 01:18:58.792
When
a man tells you


01:18:58.794 --> 01:19:01.764
you're doin' the right thing...


01:19:03.799 --> 01:19:07.870
he means you're doin'
the right thing for him.


01:19:21.816 --> 01:19:24.587
Water heater's busted again.


01:19:29.124 --> 01:19:32.493
What, it's gonna take two of
y'all to fix the water heater?


01:19:32.495 --> 01:19:34.494
Apparently the FBI have
rules about male agents


01:19:34.496 --> 01:19:36.566
being left alone with
female informants.


01:19:36.598 --> 01:19:38.234
That's funny.


01:19:38.267 --> 01:19:39.669
Nobody told me.


01:19:41.469 --> 01:19:43.606
Yeah, nobody told me either.


01:19:43.638 --> 01:19:46.842
They damn well
should have.


01:19:46.909 --> 01:19:48.777
I knew Mark didn't
have no use for me no more.


01:19:50.079 --> 01:19:51.845
He'd already told me he
was turning his drug case


01:19:51.847 --> 01:19:53.182
over to fat Bob.


01:19:57.520 --> 01:19:59.289
But when I heard he
was leaving town,


01:19:59.321 --> 01:20:04.026
and he didn't have the guts
to tell me to my face...


01:20:05.828 --> 01:20:08.531
That I had to see for myself.


01:20:12.468 --> 01:20:13.369
I've been fuckin'
your husband!


01:20:13.436 --> 01:20:15.170
You know that?


01:20:15.204 --> 01:20:16.504
I said...


01:20:16.539 --> 01:20:21.210
I've been fuckin' your fuckin'
husband, you stupid cow!


01:20:22.977 --> 01:20:23.678
Oh, what?


01:20:23.713 --> 01:20:25.880
Don't that mean nothin' to you?


01:20:25.882 --> 01:20:28.884
Don't that make
you feel nothin'?


01:20:29.552 --> 01:20:31.721
It makes me feel bad.


01:20:32.387 --> 01:20:33.822
For you.


01:20:33.856 --> 01:20:35.523
That you wanted a
better life so much


01:20:35.557 --> 01:20:39.528
that you thought you
could just take mine.


01:20:39.562 --> 01:20:41.398
It's not gonna happen.


01:20:49.871 --> 01:20:50.874
Shit.


01:20:56.044 --> 01:20:59.882
I guess everybody
got what they wanted.


01:20:59.915 --> 01:21:03.386
Mark was the golden
boy of the FBI.


01:21:03.419 --> 01:21:05.655
This is Mark
Putnam, everybody.


01:21:05.687 --> 01:21:07.253
He's broken more cases
in his first year


01:21:07.255 --> 01:21:08.857
than any two of you together.


01:21:08.891 --> 01:21:10.659
If you want to learn
how to be meticulous


01:21:10.692 --> 01:21:13.329
and thorough, watch this guy.


01:21:16.766 --> 01:21:17.900
Kathy
got the big house


01:21:17.932 --> 01:21:20.369
and, of course, Mr. Perfect.


01:21:20.402 --> 01:21:21.670
Sold!


01:21:22.739 --> 01:21:25.773
Rufus Greene
retired to Mexico.


01:21:25.775 --> 01:21:29.178
Denver Rhodes got 30
grand and blew it.


01:21:29.212 --> 01:21:33.915
Fat Bob got to run the
Pikeville FBI all by himself.


01:21:33.950 --> 01:21:37.786
Even my dumb ass brother
Bones got off for time served.


01:21:37.852 --> 01:21:40.287
Me?
Well, guess what I got.


01:21:40.289 --> 01:21:41.256
Traitor!


01:21:43.692 --> 01:21:45.395
Come on, get up, Susie!


01:21:46.529 --> 01:21:48.461
Get over here, bitch!


01:22:00.442 --> 01:22:01.710
Come on, Georgia!


01:22:01.744 --> 01:22:03.647
You stupid mother!


01:22:06.115 --> 01:22:10.085
You'd sell your
fuckin' husband, bitch!


01:22:10.119 --> 01:22:11.554
Help me.


01:22:11.587 --> 01:22:15.324
Why think you can come around
here anymore, I don't know!


01:22:25.901 --> 01:22:26.902
Bitch.


01:22:34.177 --> 01:22:37.010
The day Mark
Putnam came to town


01:22:37.012 --> 01:22:39.683
is the day my life went to shit.


01:22:40.615 --> 01:22:43.953
You wanna do somethin'
about it, Susie?


01:22:44.352 --> 01:22:45.355
Like what?


01:22:46.655 --> 01:22:48.189
And don't call me Susie.


01:22:48.191 --> 01:22:50.794
Like file an
official complaint.


01:22:51.794 --> 01:22:52.929
The bureau'd take
your allegations


01:22:52.962 --> 01:22:55.531
very, very seriously.


01:22:55.597 --> 01:22:57.131
I look to you like
the kinda person


01:22:57.165 --> 01:23:00.868
gets revenge by
filing a complaint?


01:23:00.870 --> 01:23:03.506
Well, what do you want to do?


01:23:03.539 --> 01:23:05.541
I'll help you do it.


01:23:05.607 --> 01:23:08.777
Whatever it is,
I'll help you do it.


01:23:13.648 --> 01:23:16.118
Want me to take you to the ER?


01:23:16.151 --> 01:23:17.153
No.


01:23:29.164 --> 01:23:30.200
I can
send you the report,


01:23:30.232 --> 01:23:32.200
but it's gonna be
heavily redacted.


01:23:35.737 --> 01:23:37.071
I can't tell you who they are.


01:23:37.138 --> 01:23:38.873
I can compromise
their operation.


01:23:38.906 --> 01:23:40.909
Illinois, 9011, yes.


01:23:42.245 --> 01:23:46.149
Arrester Mr. Abbons
Huggins, address 141203


01:23:46.981 --> 01:23:48.350
- Lakeshore Drive.
- Hey, Mark.


01:23:48.383 --> 01:23:49.817
You know someone named Susan?


01:23:49.852 --> 01:23:52.088
Who may be a tad hostile?


01:23:54.255 --> 01:23:58.261
Yeah, I'll take her
in the conference room.


01:24:07.436 --> 01:24:08.438
Hello?


01:24:09.704 --> 01:24:11.339
Hello...


01:24:11.374 --> 01:24:12.375
Mr. Perfect.


01:24:14.410 --> 01:24:16.679
You know, you should've
been an agent, Susan.


01:24:16.713 --> 01:24:17.780
How'd you find me?


01:24:17.847 --> 01:24:19.549
Cut the crap, Mark!


01:24:19.581 --> 01:24:20.549
I'm pregnant.


01:24:20.583 --> 01:24:22.448
What are you...


01:24:22.450 --> 01:24:23.886
Jesus Christ.


01:24:25.286 --> 01:24:25.888
Susan...


01:24:26.856 --> 01:24:29.459
You wanna
know what he said?


01:24:29.525 --> 01:24:30.558
Are you sure?


01:24:30.593 --> 01:24:31.527
He asked
me if I was sure


01:24:31.560 --> 01:24:33.027
it was his, son of a bitch.


01:24:33.062 --> 01:24:34.096
I'm not saying it like that.


01:24:34.129 --> 01:24:35.864
I'm saying, are
you sure it's mine?


01:24:35.897 --> 01:24:37.432
You find
out what a man's made of


01:24:37.465 --> 01:24:38.467
when you catch him by surprise.


01:24:38.534 --> 01:24:39.768
Look...


01:24:39.802 --> 01:24:41.469
I'm coming back to court
in Pikeville in two weeks.


01:24:41.536 --> 01:24:42.972
We'll talk then.


01:24:43.606 --> 01:24:44.808
Okay?


01:25:32.321 --> 01:25:35.656
What the fuck
took you so long?


01:25:35.691 --> 01:25:36.425
What?


01:25:36.458 --> 01:25:37.459
I saw you park!


01:25:37.493 --> 01:25:41.528
What the fuck took you
so long to get up here?


01:25:41.530 --> 01:25:42.599
What are you talkin' about?


01:25:42.632 --> 01:25:44.333
Oh, I am sick of
this shit, Mark!


01:25:44.365 --> 01:25:47.870
You fucked me over,
you piece of shit!


01:25:49.638 --> 01:25:50.940
How'd you even
know I was here?


01:25:50.972 --> 01:25:53.676
'Cause I'm staying here?


01:25:53.709 --> 01:25:55.478
In the Pikeville?


01:25:55.511 --> 01:25:56.611
Who's payin' for that?


01:25:56.645 --> 01:25:57.647
The FBI.


01:25:58.713 --> 01:25:59.781
Oh, you mean Bob Singer.


01:25:59.815 --> 01:26:00.848
Yeah.


01:26:00.883 --> 01:26:01.784
And why is Bob
Singer paying for you


01:26:01.816 --> 01:26:02.984
to stay the Pikeville?


01:26:03.017 --> 01:26:06.154
Oh, so I can chew your
head off, that's why.


01:26:06.188 --> 01:26:09.825
'Cause he hates the
fact that I fucked you


01:26:09.859 --> 01:26:12.160
and I will not fuck his fat ass!


01:26:12.194 --> 01:26:13.196
Shh!


01:26:13.228 --> 01:26:15.231
I told you I'd make
time this weekend.


01:26:15.298 --> 01:26:16.999
I'm ready now.


01:26:17.031 --> 01:26:18.333
Well I'm not, Susan.


01:26:18.368 --> 01:26:20.302
I'm beat, and I gotta prep
this drug trafficking case


01:26:20.334 --> 01:26:21.870
all day at the
courthouse tomorrow.


01:26:21.904 --> 01:26:25.741
You know, I shoulda killed
her when I had the chance.


01:26:25.807 --> 01:26:27.542
Killed who, Susan?


01:26:29.911 --> 01:26:31.914
I didn't mean that.


01:26:33.048 --> 01:26:34.583
Just slipped out.


01:26:35.551 --> 01:26:36.919
I mean, Jesus, look at you.


01:26:36.986 --> 01:26:39.488
You're so stoned, you don't
even know what you're saying.


01:26:39.521 --> 01:26:41.557
Fuck you, Mark.


01:26:42.659 --> 01:26:44.426
When was the
last time you ate?


01:26:44.493 --> 01:26:45.160
Huh?


01:26:45.194 --> 01:26:48.095
Have you eaten anything all day?


01:26:48.097 --> 01:26:49.831
Let me drop my bags,
and I'll take you


01:26:49.865 --> 01:26:52.068
to the drive-thru, okay?


01:26:52.767 --> 01:26:53.936
Okay?


01:26:54.770 --> 01:26:56.004
Okay.


01:27:11.553 --> 01:27:13.121
I ain't got no money.


01:27:13.187 --> 01:27:15.454
Everyone in this
town wants me dead.


01:27:15.456 --> 01:27:16.424
Jesus.


01:27:16.459 --> 01:27:19.626
So what happened to
witness protection?


01:27:19.628 --> 01:27:22.462
They gave me the cash
to relocate on my own.


01:27:22.464 --> 01:27:24.132
Okay, so
what happened to that?


01:27:24.199 --> 01:27:25.632
What happened to it?


01:27:25.634 --> 01:27:26.802
I'm an addict.


01:27:26.869 --> 01:27:29.706
What do you think
happened to it?


01:27:30.905 --> 01:27:33.975
You left me barefoot
and pregnant, Mark.


01:27:34.043 --> 01:27:35.611
What do you want
me to do, Susan?


01:27:35.645 --> 01:27:37.780
I want you to suffer.


01:27:37.812 --> 01:27:39.882
I mean about the baby.


01:27:39.915 --> 01:27:42.649
I'm a tell your
wife about the baby.


01:27:42.651 --> 01:27:44.420
I'm gonna tell the FBI.


01:27:44.453 --> 01:27:47.623
Fat Bob says they will
fire you on the spot!


01:27:47.655 --> 01:27:49.324
Fat Bob again, huh?


01:27:49.392 --> 01:27:52.061
You're everything that
he hates about the bureau.


01:27:52.093 --> 01:27:55.964
Bunch of candy-ass hypocrites
wearin' suits and ties.


01:27:55.998 --> 01:27:58.933
Well he don't wear
no suit and tie.


01:27:58.968 --> 01:28:02.071
And he don't fuck his
informants neither.


01:28:03.304 --> 01:28:07.341
Susan, to be honest, you
don't look five months pregnant.


01:28:07.343 --> 01:28:10.179
They say drugs keep it small.


01:28:13.514 --> 01:28:17.352
Have you thought about
getting an abortion?


01:28:35.337 --> 01:28:40.375
Can we please just try and
have a reasonable conversation?


01:28:47.014 --> 01:28:49.549
You were gonna save me.


01:28:49.551 --> 01:28:54.624
I needed someone to save me,
and you were gonna be the one.


01:28:54.656 --> 01:28:56.726
You even said so yourself.


01:29:03.231 --> 01:29:04.966
Susan, if I could
drop everything


01:29:05.000 --> 01:29:06.802
and start again, I would.


01:29:08.070 --> 01:29:12.208
I'm trying to do the
right thing, I just can't.


01:29:13.409 --> 01:29:16.344
Look, the most important
thing here's the baby.


01:29:16.378 --> 01:29:17.577
What do you want to do about it?


01:29:17.579 --> 01:29:20.747
Do you want me and
Kathy to raise it?


01:29:20.749 --> 01:29:22.250
You and Kathy?


01:29:23.585 --> 01:29:25.855
I am a good mother!


01:29:25.887 --> 01:29:26.888
Come on, Susan.


01:29:26.922 --> 01:29:28.056
Where are your kids now?


01:29:28.089 --> 01:29:30.592
You take that back,
you son of a bitch.


01:29:30.659 --> 01:29:31.694
How dare you!


01:29:33.596 --> 01:29:34.427
Take it back!


01:29:43.571 --> 01:29:44.739
Christ!


01:29:44.772 --> 01:29:46.340
What the hell's the
matter with you, Susan?


01:29:46.374 --> 01:29:47.610
You tryin' to kill us both?


01:29:47.676 --> 01:29:48.442
Me?


01:29:48.444 --> 01:29:50.413
You're the one
who's screwin' me.


01:29:50.445 --> 01:29:53.948
I'll be damned if I'll watch
you prance back to Chicago


01:29:53.950 --> 01:29:56.185
with that stuck-up
wife of yours.


01:29:56.218 --> 01:29:58.120
How about we leave my
wife out of this, okay?


01:29:58.187 --> 01:30:00.022
She's the only one who hasn't
brought this on herself.


01:30:00.054 --> 01:30:02.023
You fucked up my life.


01:30:02.057 --> 01:30:03.892
Oh, Jesus, just tell
me, Susan, please,


01:30:03.926 --> 01:30:06.262
what is it that you want?


01:30:06.294 --> 01:30:09.297
I want you to have
this baby with me.


01:30:09.365 --> 01:30:11.600
I want you to be
there when he's born.


01:30:11.633 --> 01:30:14.801
And I want you to sign the
birth certificate as his daddy.


01:30:14.803 --> 01:30:17.970
Second, I want you to
leave that whore, Kathy,


01:30:17.972 --> 01:30:19.639
and those stuck-up brat kids.


01:30:19.641 --> 01:30:22.309
I swear, if you say one
more thing about my wife...


01:30:22.311 --> 01:30:23.612
Oh, what are
you gonna do, huh?


01:30:23.645 --> 01:30:24.312
You gonna hit me?


01:30:24.379 --> 01:30:25.314
Well, go ahead, 'cause men


01:30:25.380 --> 01:30:28.817
have been hittin'
me my whole life.


01:30:28.883 --> 01:30:29.618
Jesus Christ.


01:30:29.651 --> 01:30:30.886
Please!


01:30:30.919 --> 01:30:33.054
Can we just try to find a
solution for our problem?


01:30:33.088 --> 01:30:34.956
Our problem?


01:30:34.990 --> 01:30:36.625
Your problem.


01:30:36.659 --> 01:30:38.594
I've never been
happier in my life.


01:30:38.627 --> 01:30:39.962
Is I.


01:30:39.995 --> 01:30:44.333
I told all my friends that
I'm a raise me an FBI baby.


01:30:45.433 --> 01:30:47.101
Oh my god, you're
fuckin' nuts.


01:30:47.136 --> 01:30:48.169
Do you really think I'd ever let


01:30:48.236 --> 01:30:49.937
a kid of mine grow up with you?


01:30:49.972 --> 01:30:50.806
Fuck you.


01:30:50.839 --> 01:30:51.671
Fuck you.


01:30:51.673 --> 01:30:52.674
Fuck you to hell!


01:30:55.576 --> 01:30:57.178
Well,
that wasn't exactly


01:30:57.245 --> 01:30:59.414
a meetin' of the minds.


01:31:05.353 --> 01:31:07.923
Least he felt bad
about the whole thing.


01:31:07.956 --> 01:31:09.424
He couldn't eat.


01:31:10.191 --> 01:31:11.860
He couldn't sleep.


01:31:19.267 --> 01:31:22.672
For months, he didn't
know what to do.


01:31:30.544 --> 01:31:33.348
Then, all of a sudden, he did.


01:31:41.557 --> 01:31:45.194
I need to
tell you something.


01:31:45.227 --> 01:31:46.395
Now?


01:31:47.228 --> 01:31:48.396
Yeah.


01:31:49.464 --> 01:31:51.801
Before I tell anyone else.


01:31:52.901 --> 01:31:54.636
It's about me and Susan.


01:31:54.669 --> 01:31:55.704
Don't.


01:31:55.736 --> 01:31:56.571
It's over.


01:31:56.637 --> 01:31:57.973
It's in the past.


01:32:00.642 --> 01:32:01.577
It's not.


01:32:12.254 --> 01:32:13.923
All right, shoot.


01:32:19.093 --> 01:32:20.929
I'm so sorry, Kathy.


01:32:25.935 --> 01:32:28.271
It's worse than you think.


01:32:30.371 --> 01:32:32.775
Did you get her pregnant?


01:32:36.578 --> 01:32:37.545
Yeah.


01:32:54.228 --> 01:32:55.397
Kathy.


01:32:56.197 --> 01:32:57.400
Don't.


01:32:59.534 --> 01:33:00.803
I didn't mean
don't have a drink.


01:33:01.369 --> 01:33:02.371
Good.


01:33:03.437 --> 01:33:05.607
I meant there's more.


01:33:15.417 --> 01:33:18.120
Fuck you, fuck you, fuck you!


01:33:19.655 --> 01:33:20.656
Fuck you!


01:33:32.601 --> 01:33:33.235
Stop!


01:33:33.267 --> 01:33:34.436
Stop it!


01:33:35.003 --> 01:33:36.170
You're not gonna win!


01:33:36.237 --> 01:33:38.340
You're never gonna win!


01:33:48.016 --> 01:33:49.018
Stop it!


01:34:38.066 --> 01:34:39.735
It was an accident.


01:34:40.636 --> 01:34:41.637
I swear.


01:34:42.338 --> 01:34:44.740
If it was an accident...


01:34:45.639 --> 01:34:48.177
why didn't you tell somebody?


01:34:51.579 --> 01:34:52.747
We were fighting.


01:34:54.048 --> 01:34:55.516
If it was an accident
while we were fighting,


01:34:55.549 --> 01:34:57.819
that's manslaughter.


01:34:57.852 --> 01:35:01.590
I'm going to Washington
today to confess.


01:35:02.758 --> 01:35:03.759
I have to.


01:35:05.160 --> 01:35:06.529
You have to?


01:35:09.263 --> 01:35:10.766
It's what my father
would've wanted.


01:35:10.833 --> 01:35:11.866
You father?


01:35:11.900 --> 01:35:13.067
You're worried
about your father?


01:35:14.436 --> 01:35:16.269
'Course I
remember those last few minutes


01:35:16.271 --> 01:35:18.373
a little different than he does.


01:35:45.600 --> 01:35:50.239
But people only remember
what they can stand to.


01:36:03.319 --> 01:36:05.387
Don't tell anyone.


01:36:05.420 --> 01:36:06.621
Not anyone.


01:36:09.157 --> 01:36:11.826
It can stay between you and me.


01:36:14.228 --> 01:36:15.998
I can live with this.


01:36:18.133 --> 01:36:19.134
I can.


01:36:25.507 --> 01:36:26.674
I can't.


01:36:31.245 --> 01:36:32.780
Baby, I've tried.


01:36:36.986 --> 01:36:38.087
I just can't.


01:36:40.588 --> 01:36:42.857
By then, Mark
wanted to be punished.


01:36:43.758 --> 01:36:45.860
He thought he deserved it.


01:36:47.195 --> 01:36:50.098
The average sentence for
manslaughter is six years.


01:36:50.132 --> 01:36:51.299
You serve two.


01:36:52.499 --> 01:36:53.801
I'm sorry.


01:36:53.834 --> 01:36:56.303
Mark
took 14 and served 10.


01:36:56.338 --> 01:36:58.874
You're just doing your job.


01:37:00.874 --> 01:37:02.876
Kathy stood by him.


01:37:02.878 --> 01:37:03.879
Or tried to.


01:37:05.280 --> 01:37:10.216
She died of drink about
a year 'fore he got out.


01:37:10.218 --> 01:37:11.218
Yes, I did.


01:37:11.285 --> 01:37:13.288
You did what, Agent Putnam?


01:37:13.320 --> 01:37:15.189
It's important that
you be specific.


01:37:15.223 --> 01:37:17.058
For a second it sounded
like you meant to say...


01:37:17.124 --> 01:37:18.893
I didn't mean that.


01:37:19.661 --> 01:37:20.896
I killed her.


01:37:21.730 --> 01:37:22.865
I broke her neck.


01:37:24.365 --> 01:37:27.502
He surprised the
hell outta people round here.


01:37:27.535 --> 01:37:32.306
They figured somebody I'd
snitched on had done it.


01:37:32.340 --> 01:37:33.874
He told 'em where
to find me, too,


01:37:33.909 --> 01:37:37.045
or they wouldn't a had
no proof of nothin'.


01:37:37.078 --> 01:37:38.880
I've got somethin'!


01:37:42.750 --> 01:37:44.082
Course, he
didn't decide to confess


01:37:44.084 --> 01:37:46.922
until 10 months
after he killed me,


01:37:46.987 --> 01:37:50.025
so the dogs got
at me pretty good.


01:37:54.862 --> 01:37:56.429
If I hadn't a been so mad,


01:37:56.431 --> 01:37:59.735
I woulda just had
the baby by myself.


01:38:03.271 --> 01:38:04.673
God damn you.


01:38:15.249 --> 01:38:16.284
That's her.


01:38:30.030 --> 01:38:31.198
I guess I was wrong


01:38:31.231 --> 01:38:33.700
about all them gettin'
what they wanted, huh?


01:38:33.735 --> 01:38:35.971
In the long run, anyways.


01:38:37.806 --> 01:38:40.909
Course, in the
long run, who does?


01:38:46.313 --> 01:38:50.753
Like I said, worst
thing about being dead,


01:38:51.652 --> 01:38:54.455
you get too much time to think.


01:39:23.418 --> 01:39:28.522
And I knew right at that
point that I had compromised


01:39:28.589 --> 01:39:32.160
everything that
I had worked for.


01:39:35.696 --> 01:39:38.032
Because I broke the first rule


01:39:39.000 --> 01:39:43.036
of an FBI agent-informant
relationship.


01:39:43.038 --> 01:39:45.473
Never sleep with
your informants.


01:39:45.505 --> 01:39:50.208
I pride myself on my ability
to compartmentalise aspects


01:39:50.210 --> 01:39:54.982
of my life, and I thought that
I could keep that in check.


01:39:55.883 --> 01:39:57.886
I cared a great deal for her.


01:39:58.518 --> 01:40:00.856
I can't lie about that.


01:40:00.888 --> 01:40:04.223
A lot of her
problems that she had


01:40:04.225 --> 01:40:06.895
were a result of her
cooperating with me.


01:40:06.962 --> 01:40:10.499
She came across the
seat and jumped on me


01:40:11.732 --> 01:40:14.067
and started punching,
and hitting,


01:40:14.134 --> 01:40:16.303
and slapping, and pulling hair.


01:40:16.337 --> 01:40:19.641
She kept comin' at
me, and I grabbed her.


01:40:19.673 --> 01:40:22.643
And I said, "Cut the crap."


01:40:22.678 --> 01:40:26.981
I didn't realise the
force that I had on her.


01:40:27.014 --> 01:40:31.085
And next thing I knew,
she was layin' into me.


01:40:33.021 --> 01:40:34.423
Nothing.


01:40:34.489 --> 01:40:36.924
Then I looked up in the air,


01:40:36.990 --> 01:40:39.861
and I said, "What do I do, dad?


01:40:40.861 --> 01:40:42.163
"What do I do?"


01:44:21.829 --> 01:44:26.829
